  "readmeSummary": "## TikTok Comments Scraper\n\nTikTok Comments Scraper extracts comments from TikTok videos and from videos belonging to specified TikTok usernames by web scraping TikTok pages, producing structured comment records that include comment text, commenter identifiers, timestamps, reaction counts (likes), reply counts and nested reply content, and identifiers linking each comment to its source video or user; the Actor supports bulk scraping of multiple posts, configurable limits for how many comments and replies to collect per post, pagination through comment threads, and emits error records for inputs that fail retrieval or return no data.\n\n## Use cases\n\n- Collect product reviews from TikTok comments for analysis and monitoring  \n- Perform sentiment analysis and social listening on comment text and reactions  \n- Research viral campaigns, trends, and audience engagement metrics  \n- Identify potentially unverified or misleading content discussed in comments  \n- Prepare or evaluate TikTok marketing campaigns using comment-level engagement data",
